case outcome_unknown_lost
kind negative
exec native-qemu
domain 2
needs tasks test-authority fault-lose
# a started task whose fate the adapter can no longer learn is OUTCOME_UNKNOWN, never success (ST8.4)
cap C => OK
bind B cap=C => OK
spawn T exit 0 bind=B => OK
run => OK
lose T => OK
wait T => OUTCOME_UNKNOWN status=1 outcome=OUTCOME_UNKNOWN
wait T => STALE
check empty
